<office:master-styles><style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="pm1"/></office:master-styles>
<office:body><office:text>
<text:p text:style-name="Title">Mixed lists and look-alikes</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Heading_20_1">1. Scope</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">This section describes the scope of the work. It does not replace the drawings or the specification, and the contractor must read all three documents together before work starts on site.</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LBullet"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Check the drawing register.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Confirm that every sheet in the issued set carries the current revision letter, the correct status code and the initials of the checker, and that superseded sheets are marked as such in the register.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Mark up clashes in red.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">The ground floor slab needs a new damp-proof membrane, and the existing screed must come out first<text:line-break/>- as noted above - before the installer can lay the membrane. The same applies to the lobby.</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LNum"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Isolate the supply at the main switch.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Lock the switch and attach a warning label.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Test the circuit with an approved voltage indicator, then prove the indicator on a known live source to show that it still works correctly after the test.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Remove the cover plate.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Heading_20_1">2. Programme</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">The programme changed twice. The first review took place on<text:line-break/>12. März 2024 in Hamburg, and the second review followed on<text:line-break/>3. April 2024 after the client approved the revised budget.</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LB-en-dash"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Fire doors</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Smoke detectors in each escape route, tested weekly and recorded in the log book that the responsible person keeps</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Emergency lighting</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">The laboratory tested forty samples from the east wall. Of these samples, the number that failed the compression test was<text:line-break/>1. The other samples passed, and the laboratory issued its certificate late in<text:line-break/>2020. The certificate is in Appendix B, together with the test log.</text:p>
</office:text></office:body>
</office:document>
